  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN248.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">iravukkuṟi ciṟaippuṟamākat talaimakaṭkuc colluvāḷāyt talaimakaṉ kēṭpat tōḻi colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What the confidante said so HE would hear [it], being one who speaks to HER when [HE] was behind the hedge during the night tryst.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN248.1">
        <l>nakainī kēḷāy tōḻi yalkal<anchor n="1"/></l>
        <l>vayanā yeṟintu vaṉpaṟaḻ <anchor n="2"/>taḻīi</l>
        <l>yiḷaiya reytutaṉ maṭakkik <anchor n="3"/>kiḷaiyoṭu</l>
        <l>nāṉmulaip piṇaval coliya kāṉoḻin</l>
        <l>tarumpuḻai<anchor n="4"/> muṭukka rāṭkuṟittu niṉṟa</l>
        <l>taṟukaṭ<anchor n="5"/> paṉṟi <anchor n="6"/>nōkkik kāṉavaṉ</l>
        <l>kuṟukiṉaṉ ṟoṭutta kūrvāyp pakaḻi</l>
        <l>maṭaicelaṉ muṉpiṟṟaṉ paṭaicelac ce<supplied>l</supplied>lā</l>
        <l>taruva<supplied>ḻi</supplied> vilaṅkumem peruviṟal pōṉmeṉa</l>
        <l><anchor n="7"/>veyyātu peyaruṅ kuṉṟa nāṭaṉ</l>
        <l>ceṟiyari ṟuṭakkaliṟ<anchor n="8"/> parīip puriyaviḻn</l>
        <l>tēntukuvavu moympiṟ pūccōr <anchor n="9"/>mālai</l>
        <l>yeṟṟimiṟ kayiṟṟi ṉeḻilvan<supplied>tu</supplied> tuyalvara</l>
        <l>vilvantu niṉṟō<supplied>ṟ</supplied> <anchor n="10"/>kaṇṭaṉa ḷaṉṉai</l>
        <l>vallē yeṉmuka nōkki</l>
        <l>nallai maṉṉeṉa nakū<supplied>u</supplied>ppeyarn tōḷē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="1">Hear you the joke, friend: at night,</l>
        <l corresp="10cd">the man from a land of hills, where</l>
        <l corresp="6">a man of the forest, looking at the fearless pig</l>
        <l corresp="5">that stood aiming at a man on the difficult forest lane,</l>
        <l corresp="4">having stayed behind in the forest in order to remove the female with sagging breasts</l>
        <l corresp="3">along with [her] offspring, having blocked the young men from reaching [them],</l>
        <l corresp="2">having thrown the strong dog [and] holding tight to the strong young one,</l>
        <l corresp="7a">as he approached</l>
        <l corresp="8">without his weapon managing to go because of the strength of the joint giving way</l>
        <l corresp="7b-d" rend="indent3">on [his] sharp-mouthed arrow that was nocked on [the bow],</l>
        <l corresp="9">saying “it seems the difficult path to our great victory is blocked”,</l>
        <l corresp="10ab" rend="indent5">comes back without discharging,</l>
        <l corresp="11">when, as the cotton thread opened because of being caught in the dense thicket,</l>
        <l corresp="12">the slipping flower garland on [his] eminent bulky shoulders</l>
        <l corresp="13">gracefully came into swinging, like a rope on a bright boat,</l>
        <l corresp="14">mother saw him come to the house [and] stand [there]</l>
        <l corresp="15">[and] looking daftly at my face</l>
        <l corresp="16">she came back smiling, saying “you are good”.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
